    <briefdescription>
<para>Scores a scraped document against the gap context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>LLM path: calls LLMPluginManager::instance().generate() when THEMIS_ENABLE_LLM is defined and a model is available. Fallback: heuristic keyword-frequency scoring (always available). </para>
